flowchart TD
    A[Open App] --> B[Load search history from AsyncStorage]
    B --> C[Display search screen]

    C --> D[User enters a word]
    D --> E[Trim and sanitize input]
    E --> F{Is input valid?}

    F -->|No| G[Show validation error]
    F -->|Yes| H[Build Dictionary API URL]

    H --> I[Send Axios GET request]
    I --> J{API response}

    J -->|Success| K[Parse JSON response]
    J -->|404 Not Found| L[Show word not found message]
    J -->|Network/API error| M[Show error message]

    K --> N[Store word data in app state]
    N --> O[Render word details]

    O --> P[Display searched word]
    O --> Q[Display phonetic spelling]
    O --> R[Display parts of speech]
    O --> S[Display definitions]
    O --> T[Display examples if available]

    O --> U{Audio URL exists?}
    U -->|Yes| V[Show pronunciation controls]
    U -->|No| W[Hide pronunciation controls]

    V --> X[Play audio]
    V --> Y[Pause audio]
    V --> Z[Stop audio]

    N --> AA[Add searched word to history]
    AA --> AB[Prevent duplicate history entries]
    AB --> AC[Save history in AsyncStorage]

    AC --> AD[Display history in drawer]

    AD --> AE{Drawer action}
    AE -->|Tap word| H
    AE -->|Delete word| AF[Remove selected word from history]
    AE -->|Clear all| AG[Clear all history]

    AF --> AC
    AG --> AC

    O --> AH[User scrolls through results]
    AH --> AI[Show New Search button]
    AI --> AJ[Scroll back to search input]
    AJ --> AK[Auto focus input]

    L --> AL[Allow retry]
    M --> AL
    AL --> H
